    "Model input/output tokens are billed separately and are not in this estimate.",
    "CPU per memory tier is not published; the engine matches tiers on RAM only.",
    "Per-minute billing with 5-minute minimum applies to \"eligible\" sessions since 2026-06-02; before that each session was billed as a full 20 minutes.",
